(Project Halcyon - Annual Report) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Project Halcyon is a fictional desalination programme run by the) Tj T*
(Ostrava Water Cooperative. This report summarises the pilot phase,) Tj T*
(the plant's output, the budget for phase two and the project team.) Tj T*
(The cooperative was founded in 2011 and serves eleven coastal villages.) Tj T*
ET
