(2. Pilot plant output) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The pilot plant at Kessel Bay produces 1,840 cubic metres of fresh) Tj T*
(water per day. Output dropped to 1,120 cubic metres per day during) Tj T*
(the February storms, when intake filters had to be cleaned hourly.) Tj T*
(Energy use averaged 3.1 kilowatt-hours per cubic metre.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
