(3. Budget) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The total budget for phase two is 4.2 million euros, approved by the) Tj T*
(cooperative board on 14 March 2025. Of this, 2.6 million euros funds) Tj T*
(a second membrane train and 0.9 million euros funds a solar array.) Tj T*
(The remaining amount is held as a contingency reserve.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
