(4. Project team) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The lead engineer is Mirela Vantongeren. Membranes are supplied by) Tj T*
(Quillfeather Membranes, a company based in Tallinn. Water quality) Tj T*
(testing is done by the Brannock Laboratory every Tuesday.) Tj T*
(Questions about the project go to the cooperative's secretary.) Tj T*
